DX Spot help

YAC fetches up to ten recent spots from the internet, newest first.
YAC sends your saved callsign to the DX cluster.
YAC tries two DX spot servers for up to 12 seconds in total.

Full stop) Next spot.
Comma) Previous spot.
Enter) Tune to the spot and apply its reported or likely mode if supported.
h) Read this help.
m) Select the radio mode. Press q to return to the current spot.
q) Return to Top Level.
r) Refresh the spot list.
w) Read the radio's signal, frequency and mode.

